  "source_type": "rss",
  "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/218694",
  "title": "从暴雨中穿行归来 ｜ 「吉考斯工业 × 重返未来：1999 」联名系列Part 2 现已发售",
  "content": "<img src=\"https://image.gcores.com/f49182a22d17b489d0503e72d7003010-1600-900.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_fill,w_626,h_292/quality,q_90\" /><p>大家好，欢迎光临吉考斯工业！</p><p>去年我们与《重返未来：1999 》合作推出了一系列联名服饰，一经上市便深受广大粉丝们的喜爱，于是今夏我们决定再度携手，以更舒适的穿着体验与更细腻的角色表达，共同开启联名系列的全新篇章。</p><p>本次新品主题将采用「哑谜」、「未锈铠」、「马库斯」、「泥鯭的士」这四位人气角色，从世界观设定、人物故事、台词中汲取灵感，将熟悉的角色印象转化为服饰设计语言，并融入多种制衣工艺细节。愿这些藏于衣服里的故事，可以陪伴各位「司辰」穿过盛夏，继续向下一段未知进发。</p><h1>重返未来：1999「向明日叩问」哑谜角色印象短袖T恤</h1><div>\n<p><a href=\"https://detail.tmall.com/item.htm?id=1074085702796\">&lt;点击购买&gt;</a></p></div><blockquote>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">“我选择让拉普拉斯的独立性研究继续下去。”</span></blockquote><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/63b3892699d24c24f2c0c680af998761-3500-4800.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/e1897e988f6d0370d0edf0ba2794c6f7-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/ba82bc30017e4fd5f00403f58a92c999-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/e0f391f0ca7cb18a37a08299d151484f-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/462576942d7e2e23504e5e6144e8a5c4-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/7c467ff4171180ecc61f823e1ecc48e5-3924-5232.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/a67959ed6f82dbb96f075d1b5250794c-4043-5390.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/026f8c4463cddaff72c79af8d76c8e68-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/ac3c8eb4799f3a86fa75794c64d2fffc-4043-5390.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><p>为了凸显这款「哑谜」短袖T恤的设计主题，我们从他在旧有定律崩塌后的挣扎与重建中汲取灵感，将文字信息、演算痕迹与密文交织于后背图案之中，勾勒出一份仿佛尚未归档的研究报告，也呈现出「精密规律」与「复杂无序」彼此碰撞的独特美感。纵横排列的数字与字母，既是哑谜梳理逻辑的精神锚点，也记录着他对未知世界从未停止的推演。</p><p>此外，领口缝线处还隐藏着摩斯密码「RESET」。点与线沿着衣领悄然延伸，象征他选择再次启程，接受拉普拉斯负责人职位的决心。</p><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/4bbbb41ebc11ba2846f4e2bfed1cac96-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/af0c8209c974eb79924b972a45c20923-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/f20f4e18b6706554b98497e6866bdccb-3420-3420.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/448bef4c73330ec4d499e803893cc7c1-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/c1b1168865fd5978c8b2b3096137786b-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/644560a6f6d80fea73dcdaec7401f11b-2709-1806.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/122df69c2631842752d41d3621249fd7-5312-3541.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/b298e7db282dc655d2bd305c8d2a4db5-3283-2189.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/a1c17930f401742823f7e0c9f833090d-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><ul>\n<li>夏日专属功能性面料，集 7A 级抗菌、防螨、凉感冰皮与负离子四大防护于一体，清爽透气，带来无感舒适的穿着体验。</li>\n<li>采用白墨打底数码直喷工艺，图案色彩饱满自然，细节清晰细腻，手感平整舒适。</li>\n<li>领口、袖口及下摆运用反缝外露设计；领口巧妙结合模拟手工刺绣缝线，将「摩斯密码」融入其中，赋予衣服独特的暗语细节。</li>\n</ul><h1>重返未来：1999「未尽的使命」未锈铠角色印象短袖衬衫</h1><div>\n<p><a href=\"https://detail.tmall.com/item.htm?id=1076121608493\">&lt;点击购买&gt;</a></p></div><blockquote>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">“某人的过去将与诗歌一同消失在风中。而今，某人会与这柄剑一起，再次以骑士的身份，为您铸下新的传奇。”</span></blockquote><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/450ad2762b3ca1c871be6b63e037669b-3500-4800.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/5731f7cb46a12efe7e2f7adeb0946d63-3939-5252.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/2f7dcc6adfc88d3fd670d1c102e03d31-3850-5133.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/55413821977bd5615d72febdd4c604d0-4160-5547.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/059a72c4837f822d5f483eb29b07eebd-4160-5547.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/c147b0fc91984bef35d24fcf51f92726-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/3291ce821cf7f2d0aabc181e6f303cdd-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/98eec6ee5ead4090349b098206f0c3ec-3883-5177.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/164f073081af9e4d72b31e04cea95cf7-3986-5316.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><p>这件「未尽的使命」短袖衬衫正属于那位即使只剩臂铠，却依然恪守礼仪与誓言的无名骑士——未锈铠。</p><p>即使姓名与功绩终将随诗歌消散，但他对友人的誓言依旧不曾改变。「未尽的使命」代表那场尚未迎来终点的守护，也回应衣服背后「加百列圣勋」所象征的高洁信念：时过境迁，身躯可以消失，荣耀可以褪色，但真正的骑士仍会执起长剑，为自己的信念战斗到最后一刻。</p><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/3b077e2f3888b786da70666995ba19f0-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/ba502b3fd93e1409ecebbd8030bfa23b-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/d0482336b6608307c3f563c285ff46f0-6064-4043.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/b45164b24f2c6adb7a5f3378077c5752-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/6085fe32d60683772b3f75d5f7f10a18-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/cee844579254c0d58a3968db5b7459ba-6064-4043.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/f9021c7153e3c4c208b3464aed548a02-6064-4043.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/38e532cf3c6910be2cd51737ba171a59-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/4d2558a7d892a87c3b5ce1a798e073ee-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><ul>\n<li>采用高精度数码定位印花工艺，图案精准对位。</li>\n<li>色彩饱满，呈现极为清晰细腻的视觉细节，手感平整舒适。</li>\n<li>领口巧妙融入金线刺绣图案，光泽细腻，质感沉稳，以精致针脚勾勒出极具辨识度的视觉焦点。</li>\n<li>领口、袖口及下摆均点缀金色装饰线，层次分明，提亮整体视觉，打破沉闷，赋予衣物丰富的细节质感。</li>\n<li>搭载可拆卸袖口飘带设计，支持自由解锁多元穿搭体验，随心切换风格。</li>\n</ul><h1>重返未来：1999「夏日序章」马库斯角色印象短袖T恤</h1><div>\n<p><a href=\"https://detail.tmall.com/item.htm?id=1076120120858\">&lt;点击购买&gt;</a></p></div><blockquote>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">“取舍才是最重要的。”</span></blockquote><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/278bc78d0463824eef67a0e3af4e7909-3500-4800.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/06d885750f4ee82e85acae2fee0e9a08-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/e2d40b3f6d56b4f2655186f7f7b9b58c-4160-5547.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/d1b4a41bdb2f8e61a0b5992bd6b6af5f-4160-5547.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/525dbe2c8ca5f42b276c1930a3603a9d-4064-5419.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/03179989acc3cef245a7532ee18ea445-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/b3853331e9d356d9dcbb4700d94185ec-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/6f80760c647e4b1888e84fe0b6817068-4034-5379.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/00f3e1c240f4049e0634bdc888675e89-4043-6064.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><p>科帕卡巴纳沙滩、海水与绿植在眼前铺开，外派调查员马库斯也终于从层叠的文件与笔记中抽离出来，享受一场属于自己的假期。 T 恤主题「夏日序章」以进阶衣着「白沙与风」为氛围原点，将明快色彩、海滩风貌与轻盈的夏日元素拆解重组，采用彩色拼贴的形式将马库斯的假日定格于服装之上，让整件T恤像是一本刚刚开启的旅行手记。</p><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/0c6abdb7dd05756a62b03c95d5a87bbd-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/1fbe08210c9a3bb490e91a6384904b3c-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/1e4a8bd73fc4e9ad4d5c71a304413eda-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/8bedfd4245a0f759d3779a784fa6ab2c-4085-2723.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/b45fc4a1e862cd28ed2ab6882cb22cfa-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/0c62408e026365cbca3d75f31991d0f5-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/89eda7e7765056fe5704bfdd1e1c4fee-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><ul>\n<li>采用成衣手工泼墨工艺，每一件皆由人工随机甩泼而成，呈现独一无二的艺术洒脱感，拒绝千篇一律。</li>\n<li>搭载白墨打底数码直喷工艺，图案色彩饱满自然，细节清晰细腻，手感平整无胶感。</li>\n</ul><h1>重返未来：1999「饮茶先啦」泥鯭的士角色印象短袖T恤</h1><div>\n<p><a href=\"https://detail.tmall.com/item.htm?id=1075128505762\">&lt;点击购买&gt;</a></p></div><blockquote>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">“有空喊我一起发财啦！”</span></blockquote><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/caafa75114ec3e59390cdd98c3974609-3500-4800.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/907381bbc144dca7775569481a8e0882-4183-5578.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/9ab8221f5c962535ee3f1474db5c76c7-4183-5578.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/b5b3ed96233ce6cc1e46b1b024e7d1d5-4062-5417.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/d53324ed2e231e9d63bbe3752ad865a3-4032-5376.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/d5afef9050988859b6e66cd287849600-3880-5173.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/1b81dda84a1184a7238d969718aa13cf-3993-5324.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/8b5da79d786521f6a22896c43597a7a9-4022-5363.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/c8f83499ba8ee28e8c9f3ea34cf59f92-4063-5417.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><p>「饮茶先啦」以香港本地文化为设计灵感，将熟悉的美食元素与街头视觉融入图案之中，并以醒目的「发财」字样点亮画面，同时呼应泥鯭的士在游戏中的经典内搭。热闹鲜明的市井气息碰上她古灵精怪的「新科学」作风，让整件T恤既有轻松诙谐的生活感，也有作为驱鬼大师的专业感。</p><div>\n<div>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/b27ba6e007f3538ee1fe6c0e34bf45bd-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/5da915a4c7e92a35ec8b9505dc281093-4091-4091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/f81cbc61931abaeb5aa952cc1b91ca91-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/8d28db8a3af26e595b25e2655d0aede8-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/38476b0ae6a595707f395cd667c51f3a-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/384f1c9892b892964e917158e1848e1b-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/66e46b12826cbcdd71d1a68d85101338-6053-4035.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/a3c72ce8860a5a86b2d0048c601da33d-6051-4034.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://image.gcores.com/69de1c01ecd53d7191984b9c3cb8344a-3341-2227.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,limit_1,m_lfit,w_700,h_2000/quality,q_90/watermark,image_d2F0ZXJtYXJrLnBuZw,g_se,x_10,y_10\" /></figure>\n</div></div><ul>\n<li>采用白墨打底数码直喷工艺，图案色彩饱满自然，细节清晰细腻，手感平整舒适。</li>\n<li>领口与下摆采用撞红色明线缝合，袖口拼接红色包边，以强烈撞色提亮视觉层次；领口搭载耐磨螺纹包边，久洗不易变形，兼具高质感与耐穿度。</li>\n<li>夏日专属功能性面料，集 7A 级抗菌、防螨、凉感冰皮与负离子四大防护于一体，清爽透气，带来无感舒适的穿着体验。</li>\n</ul><p></p><ul>\n<li>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">服装设计：嘉佳</span></li>\n<li>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">平面设计：家良</span></li>\n<li>\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">美术指导：HOW</span></li>\n</ul>",
